  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ガラルちほうの　そらでは　てきなし。\nくろびかりする　はがねの　すがたは\nあいてを　いあつし　おそれさせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가라르지방의 하늘에는 적수가 없다.\n검고 윤이 나는 강철의 자태는\n상대에게 위압감을 주어 겁먹게 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在伽勒爾地區的空中所向無敵。\n牠那黑得發亮的鋼鐵之軀\n有著讓敵人畏懼的威懾力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il n’a aucun rival dans le ciel de Galar.\nL’aspect intimidant de son corps d’acier noir\net lustré inspire la crainte chez ses ennemis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Niemand wagt es, ihm den Himmel über Galar\nstreitig zu machen. Sein schwarz glänzendes,\nstählernes Äußeres schüchtert jeden Gegner ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No tiene rival en los cielos de Galar. El acero\nnegro y lustroso de su cuerpo intimida a\ncualquier adversario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nei cieli di Galar non ha rivali. La vista del suo\ncorpo di acciaio nero e lucente intimorisce\ni suoi avversari.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon reigns supreme in the skies of the\nGalar region. The black luster of its steel body\ncould drive terror into the heart of any foe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ガラル地方の　空では　敵なし。\n黒光りする　鋼の　姿は\n相手を　威圧し　恐れさせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在伽勒尔地区的空中所向披靡。\n它那黑得发亮的钢铁之躯\n有着让敌人畏惧的威慑力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No tiene rival en los cielos de Galar. El acero\nnegro y lustroso de su cuerpo intimida a\ncualquier adversario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひこう　のうりょくに　すぐれていて\nとても　かしこいため　ガラルちほうで\nそらの　タクシーとして　かつやく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "비행 능력이 뛰어나고\n매우 영리해 가라르지방에서\n하늘의 택시로 활약한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有優秀飛行能力和\n極度聰明頭腦的牠在伽勒爾地區\n從事飛翔計程車的工作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grâce à son adresse remarquable en vol\net sa grande intelligence, il travaille comme\ntaxi volant de Galar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aufgrund seiner unübertroffenen Flugfertigkeiten\nund seiner hohen Intelligenz ist es in der\nGalar-Region als Flugtaxi im Einsatz.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Debido a su excelente capacidad de vuelo y a su\ngran inteligencia, ejerce de taxi volador en Galar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È dotato di eccellenti capacità di volo e di\ngrande intelligenza. Nella regione di Galar si\nrende utile come taxi del cielo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "With their great intellect and flying skills, these\nPokémon very successfully act as the Galar\nregion’s airborne taxi service.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "飛行能力に　優れていて\nとても　賢いため　ガラル地方で\n空の　タクシーとして　活躍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有优秀飞行能力和极度\n聪明头脑的它在伽勒尔地区\n从事飞翔出租车的工作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Debido a su excelente capacidad de vuelo y a su\ngran inteligencia, ejerce de taxi volador en Galar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひこうちゅう　てんてきに　ねらわれてきゃくも　きけんなので　パルデアではタクシーの　しごとが　できないのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "비행 중에 천적에게 공격을 받으면 승객도 위험해질 수 있어서 팔데아에서는 택시로 활용할 수 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如果在飛行中遭到天敵的襲擊，也會給乘客帶來危險，因此在帕底亞無法從事計程車的工作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ne peut pas servir de taxi dans le ciel de Paldea en raison des attaques de ses adversaires, qui pourraient mettre sa clientèle en danger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In Paldea dient es nicht als Flugtaxi, da die in der Luft erfolgenden Angriffe seiner natürlichen Feinde die Passagiere gefährden würden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Debido al peligro que supondrían los ataques de sus enemigos naturales para los pasajeros, este Pokémon no puede ejercer de taxi en Paldea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A Paldea non può fare da taxi, poiché gli attacchi dei suoi nemici naturali metterebbero in pericolo i passeggeri durante il volo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Corviknight can’t serve as a taxi service in Paldea because the Pokémon’s natural predators will attack it while it flies, endangering the customer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "飛行中　天敵に　狙われて客も　危険なので　パルデアではタクシーの　仕事が　できないのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "若在飞行中遭到天敌袭击的话，对乘客来说也很危险，因此无法在帕底亚从事出租车的工作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Debido al peligro que supondrían los ataques de sus enemigos naturales para los pasajeros, este Pokémon no puede ejercer de taxi en Paldea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はねの　いちぶが　はがねに　へんか。おもたい　つばさを　ものともせずにおおぞらを　ゆうゆうと　とびまわる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "깃털의 일부가 강철로 변화했다. 무거운 날개에도 아랑곳하지 않고 넓은 하늘을 유유히 날아다닌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "部分的羽毛變成了鋼鐵。即使翅膀沉重也能夠悠遊自在地飛在空中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une partie de ses ailes s’est transformée en acier. Malgré leur poids, il vole sans aucun problème.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Obwohl seine Flügel nun deutlich schwerer sind, da sie zum Teil aus Stahl bestehen, segelt es mit Leichtigkeit durch die Lüfte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parte de sus alas se ha convertido en acero, pero es capaz de surcar los cielos con facilidad a pesar de su peso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una parte delle sue ali si è tramutata in acciaio, ma riesce a librarsi in volo tranquillamente malgrado il peso aggiuntivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although its wings have partly turned to steel and become heavy as a result, this Pokémon flies through the skies with ease.",
      "language": {
